     :         RankJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, on=[(id@4, post_id@1)], order=[reputation@2 DESC NULLS LAST, id@1 ASC NULLS LAST, id@4 ASC NULLS LAST, id@7 ASC NULLS LAST]
     :           ProjectionExec: expr=[ctid_0@0 as ctid_0, id@1 as id, reputation@2 as reputation, ctid_1@3 as ctid_1, id@4 as id]
     :             RankJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, on=[(id@1, user_id@2)], order=[reputation@2 DESC NULLS LAST]
     :               CooperativeExec
     :                 PgSearchScan: table=u, segments=2, lazy_sort=19, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"bio","query_string":"rust","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
     :               CooperativeExec
     :                 PgSearchScan: table=p, segments=2, lazy_sort=0, dynamic_filters=1, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"title","query_string":"bm25","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
     :           CooperativeExec
     :             PgSearchScan: table=c, segments=2, lazy_sort=0, dynamic_filters=1, query={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"body","query_string":"helpful","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
